 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Before the larks were singing, before the kettle's call",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The light came over the mountain and spilled across the wall",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No word was ever spoken, no voice was ever heard",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But all the sky was preaching and every cloud a word",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The heavens declare the glory of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The skies proclaim the work of his hands",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Day after day they pour forth speech",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Night after night they reveal knowledge",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The sun comes like a bridegroom, rejoicing in his strength",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He runs from end to end of heaven the whole of the day's length",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And nothing hides from his warming, no valley and no stone",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And so the word of the LORD goes out to make his goodness known",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The heavens declare the glory of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The skies proclaim the work of his hands",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Day after day they pour forth speech",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Night after night they reveal knowledge",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The law of the LORD is perfect, reviving the soul",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "More desirable than gold, than much pure gold",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sweeter than honey, than honey from the comb",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May the words of my mouth and the meditation of my heart",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be pleasing in your sight, O LORD, my rock and my redeemer",
